  "key_insight": "Gumtree ranks for Staffy searches on the strength of a general classifieds domain, not breed content: its Staffy town pages are thin, noindexed feeds of a handful of private adverts (the Liverpool one holds none of its own), with no guide, price advice, health or licence information. BSUK can beat it with indexable, breeder-owned blue Staffy pages per city that carry what a feed cannot: named health results, a stated price, the parents and a direct enquiry."
